# Hawkeye's Bow: "Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has reach. Whenever equipped creature becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to each
# opponent." Bot1 equips one of two Memnites (a 2/1 with reach beside a plain 1/1). On turn 3 both attack and become tapped, but
# only the equipped one's tapping triggers the Bow (one trigger on the stack): Bot2 takes 1 from it, then 2 + 1 combat damage
# (16). On turn 5 the Bow is moved to the other Memnite (equip {1}) and the first attacks alone: unequipped it is 1/1 without
# reach and its tapping triggers nothing (Bot2 is at 15 after its 1 combat damage).

